request: Add a button that clears every movie whose `seen` flag is true from the watchlist.

governor turn 1: plan -> watchlist-store, watchlist  (The request's "seen" flag maps to the app's existing `watched` flag (WatchItem.watched / toggleWatched / watchedCount — there is no other flag on watchlist items). Plan: the store gains a bulk-removal method `clearWatched()`, and the watchlist page gains a "Clear seen movies" button that calls it — rendered only while at least one movie is watched, with a screen-reader announcement reporting how many were removed. Only watchlist-store and watchlist need to change; all other units are untouched.)
round 1: owners watchlist-store=ok watchlist=ok; oracle RED
